{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/991828-seeking-players-for-my-home-my-fortress-farp","id":991828,"title":"Seeking players for My Home, My Fortress (FARP)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-23T06:46:14-07:00","id":991828,"title":"Seeking players for My Home, My Fortress (FARP)","content":"I'm looking for four players who would like to participate in a new Mage: the Awakening 2nd edition chronicle. The game centers around a cabal of established mages arriving to London, England, on Monday, June 29th 1859.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> This is a game of politics, spying, social maneuvering, secrets and Mysteries. I have lovingly hand-crafted a detailed Awakened history interwoven with real-life history that spans the first half of the 19th century. I would like to run a FARP (Forum Action Roleplaying) that runs alongside a more tradition tabletop chronicle, which I'm currently running for my friends. They are playing the members of the Baring family. Bankers and politicians that shape the future of entire nations. Your cabal isn't quite so illustrious, but neither is it weighed down with so many expectations. Not everyone is going to try and take advantage of you or manipulate you with their every word. When you are not roleplaying the sons and daughters of the richest family in the entire world it is a different kind of experience. However, you are seen as outsiders. Potential threats and (known) agents of foreign powers. So, it's not like I'm giving you an easier experience - just different.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I'm looking for proactive players who want to play around in a sandbox that I have crafted. I have an overarching storyline to tell, but you are not the main focus of said storyline - the other player group is. Not to worry: I have dozens of smaller storyarchs, which are independent of each other, yet woven into an interconnected web that is the framework of this chronicle. As agents of a foreign power I want you to represent an unknown factor on the grand chessboard that is this chronicle. There are plenty of NPCs that I could cast in this role, but I find this option infinitely more interesting. As a cabal I want you to craft your own storyarch, and I'll incorporate that into both chronicles. And, of course you can have your own individual storyarchs. I'll be happy to help with all of that because I'm looking for people who want to participate in a collaborative storytelling experience. I'm not looking for a group of antagonists to counter every move the other group makes, but if that's what you want then I'm not going to simply say &quot;no&quot;.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Your actions will have a direct impact on the other game and vice versa. However, the central concept of the game is that the two cabals will never meet each other in person. You can message each other and I'll relay it all between groups. You might see their characters at a party or official event, but never get the chance to talk to each other face-to-face. It's just one of those things that is Destined never to happen and you need to be okay with that going into the game I'm offering. At the start of the FARP the other player group doesn't know about you and that's on purpose. It is up to you how quickly they become aware of you. Maybe they never will? I'll not make that easy for you, but it is possible.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> For additional background information please follow the link below. Once accepted into the game you'll be given access to plenty of more material to draw inspiration from. And, of course, I'll be happy to answer any questions you have right here in this thread.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.myth-weavers.com/showthread.php?t=377091\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.myth-weavers.com/showthread.php?t=377091</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T08:13:54-07:00","id":991857,"title":"","content":"Hi, I'm intrigued and would like to submit myself for consideration, however, I'm unfamiliar with the term FARP. What makes a FARP, a FARP?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T10:29:45-07:00","id":991896,"title":"","content":"FARP just means that we will be playing in a forum, so every day you can write one or more posts in a thread titled something like &quot;Chapter 1: Docks of London&quot;, &quot;Chapter 2: Hiding in Whitechapel&quot;, and so on. And although it takes a little getting used to, it is just like playing a regular tabletop RPG. The difference is that we will have separate threads for Out of Character, where we talk about the game and make dice rolls, and In Character, where we tell a collaborate story by writing it all together.<br /> <br /> You'll start with a fully Awakened mage with 15 XP to further customize your character. You'll get the opportunity to build a cabal with other players and then tell a story of your choosing in the sandbox, which I have filled with NPCs, news articles, historical venues and such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","user":"TelperionST","date":". 10-23-2016, 01:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T10:50:41-07:00","id":991906,"title":"","content":"I'm interested. While I've found the Mage setting to be very intriguing for a while, I didn't want to spend on Mage 2e without knowing about a actual available group. So assuming that not having 2e right away is not a dealbreaker for you, I would still need some help getting used to the system.<br /> <br /> Questions: are all players from the same foreign power? How synchronized would you need your backstories to be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12051-kvedulf","name":"Kvedulf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T11:12:53-07:00","id":991917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kvedulf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/991828-seeking-players-for-my-home-my-fortress-farp?p=991906#post991906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm interested. While I've found the Mage setting to be very intriguing for a while, I didn't want to spend on Mage 2e without knowing about a actual available group. So assuming that not having 2e right away is not a dealbreaker for you, I would still need some help getting used to the system.</div> </div> </div> </div>You don't need the book immediately, if you are willing to play a Sleepwalker to test the game out. However, in all honesty, you do need the book to play a fully Awakened mage, because of the way Reach works. I'm okay with you playing a Sleepwalker, if you are okay with being nowhere near the power level of a fully Awakened mage.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kvedulf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/991828-seeking-players-for-my-home-my-fortress-farp?p=991906#post991906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Questions: are all players from the same foreign power? How synchronized would you need your backstories to be?</div> </div> </div> </div>It would make the game more simple for you to be from the same foreign power, but I'm giving a lot of creative control over to the players. So, if you want to play a French character, and another players wants to be Italian or German, then I'm fine with that. More diverse backgrounds translate to more complex inter-cabal social dynamics. Potentially with colliding priorities and goals.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T17:17:39-07:00","id":992116,"title":"","content":"Ah, I'm more used to seeing the moniker PbP (Play by Post) for forum based games, hence my confusion. I would definitely be interested in playing. I am curious, with the beginning point in the timeline, how long within the game do you think the timeline will progress? I ask because I'm wondering if you plan to keep it going all the way through to the formation of the Free Council since that occurs in 1899 (and thus may make playing members of the Nameless who became the Free Council later in the setting attractive).<br /> <br /> Personally I tend towards playing social &quot;face&quot; characters and would be interested in playing as either a Silver Ladder or Mysterium member. Possibly of either Dutch or Indian descent depending on what the player group wants to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T21:24:34-07:00","id":992241,"title":"","content":"I would maybe be interested in playing an Indian character in the spirit of Captain Nemo, willing to temporarily work for a European power in the name of opposing the British Empire. I was thinking a combative Arrow type, but Nameless would be fun too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T21:49:49-07:00","id":992250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/991828-seeking-players-for-my-home-my-fortress-farp?p=992241#post992241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would maybe be interested in playing an Indian character in the spirit of Captain Nemo, willing to temporarily work for a European power in the name of opposing the British Empire. I was thinking a combative Arrow type, but Nameless would be fun too.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a high-risk, high-reward character thanks to the Indian Mutiny of 1857. Having said that it's an interesting choice, so please head on over to Myth-Weavers and add your concept to the thread over there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T22:03:00-07:00","id":992260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gullinbursti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/991828-seeking-players-for-my-home-my-fortress-farp?p=992116#post992116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, I'm more used to seeing the moniker PbP (Play by Post) for forum based games, hence my confusion. I would definitely be interested in playing. I am curious, with the beginning point in the timeline, how long within the game do you think the timeline will progress? I ask because I'm wondering if you plan to keep it going all the way through to the formation of the Free Council since that occurs in 1899 (and thus may make playing members of the Nameless who became the Free Council later in the setting attractive).<br /> <br /> Personally I tend towards playing social &quot;face&quot; characters and would be interested in playing as either a Silver Ladder or Mysterium member. Possibly of either Dutch or Indian descent depending on what the player group wants to do.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't hold canon (such as it is) in high regard, which is one of the reasons why I jumped from MtA to MtAw. The Nameless Order is definitely a thing in my chronicle. The Free Council has yet to officially become a thing, but depending on how things go that might happen towards the end of the chronicle. Or, in the middle of it, if either player group decides that they are going heavily back the Nameless Order. Timeline-wise I'm actually not certain how long the game will go into the future, but I would expect no more than a year.<br /> <br /> As mentioned above: Indian characters are high-risk, high-reward. You can play one, but it's going to be a bumpy ride.<br /> <br /> Please do head on over to Myth-Weavers and add your character concept to the thread over there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T22:18:21-07:00","id":992266,"title":"","content":"You intend to run this over on m-w, then?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T01:38:28-07:00","id":992298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>thenate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/991828-seeking-players-for-my-home-my-fortress-farp?p=992266#post992266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You intend to run this over on m-w, then?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, I like the environment, because I have full control over the game's subforum. I can create folders for chapters, move posts around, clean anything unwanted out of the forum and so on. The site is geared towards D&amp;D, Pathfinder and the like, but is also perfecty fine for story driven games. I could do it on this site, but I wouldn't have access to even half the tools that m-w offers. Also, I get exposure to a much larger player base.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T03:25:18-07:00","id":992315,"title":"","content":"How active would you expect your players to be? I like the idea of this, and immediately started conjuring up a Fenian Mastigos who's a member of that new-fangled Irish Republican Brotherhood established in 1858, but I can be a bit busy these days. The idea of a known dissident coming over and nobody being wholly sure of his intentions does sound appealing though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12121-ainsoph","name":"AinSoph","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T04:43:13-07:00","id":992328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AinSoph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/991828-seeking-players-for-my-home-my-fortress-farp?p=992315#post992315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How active would you expect your players to be? I like the idea of this, and immediately started conjuring up a Fenian Mastigos who's a member of that new-fangled Irish Republican Brotherhood established in 1858, but I can be a bit busy these days. The idea of a known dissident coming over and nobody being wholly sure of his intentions does sound appealing though.</div> </div> </div> </div>One post per day per player is what I'm aiming at. It doesn't have to be very long, but something that's thought-out and adds something to the game. Nodding heads and shuffling feet aren't exactly captivating storytelling moments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T07:57:39-07:00","id":992385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TelperionST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/991828-seeking-players-for-my-home-my-fortress-farp?p=992328#post992328\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> One post per day per player is what I'm aiming at. It doesn't have to be very long, but something that's thought-out and adds something to the game. Nodding heads and shuffling feet aren't exactly captivating storytelling moments.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll toss my character into the myth-weavers ring so. We'll see how it goes. I'd like to sink my teeth into 2e as a player. PbP sounds like a good format to try it on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12121-ainsoph","name":"AinSoph","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T10:13:55-07:00","id":992445,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested and willing to play, if i'm accepted. I'd like to play a spanish mage, coming from Salamanca, if it is possible. I'm a little concerned about the daily posting, as being english not my first tongue i struggle with the time when writing on it, but... you've made quite an interesting post.<br /> <br /> PS. Oh wait, i've arrived late. I see you have 4 players already. My bad!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":1349,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","user":"Phersus","date":".  Adding the PS. 10-24-2016, 01:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T11:26:16-07:00","id":992503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phersus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/991828-seeking-players-for-my-home-my-fortress-farp?p=992445#post992445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">PS. Oh wait, i've arrived late. I see you have 4 players already. My bad!</div> </div> </div> </div>No, I have two players. So, you are welcome to submit a concept and head straight on into the game's subforum where you have a lot of reading to do. I can't promise you a spot, but you can still get in.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T03:53:18-07:00","id":992877,"title":"","content":"Player recruitment for My Home, My Fortress has concluded.<br /> <br /> Thank you all for participating! My next project is tentatively titled &quot;Silk Strands Across Victorian London&quot;. The game system is Changeling: the Lost 2nd Edition. Recruitment will start between September and December 2017.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}